    {
      "name": "Philidor 3...Bg4",
      "cards": [
        {
          "id": "phil-bg4-name",
          "front": {
            "text": "Black has just played 2...d6. Which defence is this, and what does the move cost Black?",
            "boards": [
              {
                "fen": "rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1",
                "orientation": "w",
                "moves": [
                  "e4",
                  "e5",
                  "Nf3",
                  "d6"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "back": {
            "text": "The Philidor Defense. 2...d6 covers the e5-pawn but does not develop a piece and locks in the f8-bishop."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "phil-bg4-passive",
          "front": {
            "text": "Why does the Philidor have the reputation of being slightly passive?",
            "boards": [
              {
                "fen": "rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1",
                "orientation": "w",
                "moves": [
                  "e4",
                  "e5",
                  "Nf3",
                  "d6"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "back": {
            "text": "C: Black voluntarily limits their options: the king's bishop can't join the game early on c5 or b4, as it can after [2...Nc6] or [2...Nf6]."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "phil-bg4-move3",
          "front": {
            "text": "What do you play and why?",
            "boards": [
              {
                "fen": "rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1",
